  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math> be a thrice differentiable function in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>)</mo></math>. Let the tangents to the curve <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math> at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>)</mo></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>)</mo></math> make angles <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math>, respectively with positive <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math>-axis. If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>27</mn><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>\"</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>  </mo></math> where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>α</mi><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi>β</mi></math> are integers, then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>α</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi></math> equals"
