  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given: </p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>tan</mi><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi>i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mfenced><mfrac><mi>dy</mi><mi>dx</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>tan</mi><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>It is given that, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>27</mn><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>\"</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math></p><p>Let, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mo>(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>\"</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p>Putting, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mo>(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>\"</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mn>1</mn></msubsup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>·</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>10</mn><mrow><mn>9</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>10</mn><mn>27</mn></mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>27</mn><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>10</mn><mn>27</mn></mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>36</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>36</mn><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi>β</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>36</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>26</mn></math></p></blockquote>"
